Subject: [PATCH net-next 3/8] net: stmmac: Fallback to dev_fwnode() if needed
Date:   Mon,  9 Mar 2020 09:36:22 +0100
Message-Id: <7eb9df9f6f05f08c11b6095087d7f86f5662e041.1583742615.git.Jose.Abreu@synopsys.com>
